# Trained Arynx (3/1): "Whenever this creature attacks while saddled, it gains first strike until end of turn. Scry 1." and "Saddle 2".
# Turn 3: two Memnites (total power 2) saddle it, it attacks, and Bot2's Memnite blocks: with first strike the Arynx kills it first and
# survives (without it the 1-power blocker would kill the 1-toughness Arynx as well). The scry sends the Island on top of Bot1's library
# to the bottom, so the next card is a Swamp. Turn 4: first strike is gone (until end of turn). Turn 5: unsaddled, it attacks, gains
# nothing, scries nothing (the Island stays where it is on the bottom, the top card is drawn), and trades with Bot2's other Memnite.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Trained Arynx
Memnite
Memnite
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Island
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Memnite
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Trained Arynx.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Trained Arynx.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Trained Arynx.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Memnite#1; Memnite#2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Trained Arynx.Saddled = true
Bot1.Attack(Trained Arynx > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Island)
Bot2.Block(Memnite#1 > Trained Arynx)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Trained Arynx.Keywords = FirstStrike
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Trained Arynx.Damage = 0
? Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Trained Arynx.Keywords = (absent)
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Trained Arynx > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Memnite > Trained Arynx)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Trained Arynx.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Arrange
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Trained Arynx
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite; Memnite
